id": 1766830, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc11vam.jpg"}], "slug": "zhongguo-shi-fuhao", "summary": "Developed by a two-person indie team, \u201cZhong Guo Shi Fu Hao\u201d (Chinese Tycoon) is a 3D city-based simulation game centered around economics and modern life.\nExperience a wide range of gameplay features including stock trading, car driving, shooting, city exploration, and the collection of money and story texts.\n\nYou can engage in real-time stock market fluctuations, buying and selling your way to sudden wealth; gather scattered banknotes around the city to trigger unique events and discover hidden narratives; or simply enjoy the sights of towns, beaches, and forests as you live the life of a modern tycoon.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/zhongguo-shi-fuhao"}